WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.390 --> 00:00:05.190
Natalia sends Rosalia a photo
of her new necklace.

2
00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:06.950
The picture is not clean.

3
00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:12.170
She asks her to clean it up
and post it on Instagram.

4
00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:17.080
Rosalia sends a clean picture
and a caption.

5
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:20.620
New jade and silver necklace.
Inquiries and DMs.

6
00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:24.680
Is that okay? Natalia says yes.
Looks great.

7
00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:28.230
Rosalia posts it. Likes come in.
